,{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定有效指标文法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)\\)</span>。带标签字母、指标推导关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bfefeed9666846e4\" href=\"?note=bfefeed9666846e4\" title=\"73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting\">73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Term}_G(w)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf T(w(i)):0\\le i&lt;|w|\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Term}_G(w)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf T(w(i)):0\\le i&lt;|w|\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{IG}}(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\langle\\mathsf N(S,\\varepsilon)\\rangle\\Rightarrow^{I*}_G\\operatorname{Term}_G(w)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{IG}}(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\langle\\mathsf N(S,\\varepsilon)\\rangle\\Rightarrow^{I*}_G\\operatorname{Term}_G(w)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{IND}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L_{\\mathsf{IG}}(G):\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{IND}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L_{\\mathsf{IG}}(G):\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>语言最终返回原字母表上的词，不返回内部标签词或非终结符的指标串。ε 仍可由空右部产生式导出，后续与 CSL 比较时必须使用带空词扩展的版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting","status":"resolved","id":"bfefeed9666846e4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting","status":"resolved","id":"bfefeed9666846e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定有效指标文法 $G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)$。带标签字母、指标推导关系见 [[73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting]]。$w\\in\\Sigma^*$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Term}_G(w)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf T(w(i)):0\\le i<|w|\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{IG}}(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\langle\\mathsf N(S,\\varepsilon)\\rangle\\Rightarrow^{I*}_G\\operatorname{Term}_G(w)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{IND}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L_{\\mathsf{IG}}(G):\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1853,"backlinks":[{"id":"9b2a2a92345299bc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}$ 为三个互异字符的字母表，$V=\\{S,T,A,B,C\\}$，$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)$、$|V|=5$ 且 $V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing$；$I=\\{f,g\\}$，$f\\ne g$，$\\varepsilon\\notin I$。指标文法语义见 [[73-df-indexed-language]]；非 CFL 的泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-348","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-indexed-language|指标文法的生成语言与语言类]]"},{"id":"636ecdcceaa84a43","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$。三类语言见 [[73-df-indexed-language]]、[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]、[[73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl]]；严格性的三块见证见 [[73-ex-indexed-equal-three-blocks]]。"},{"id":"7552cf9d94a12108","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$。0L 和指标语言类分别见 [[73-df-zero-l-system]]、[[73-df-indexed-language]]。"}],"outgoing":["bfefeed9666846e4"]}